# Gemini API key used by the PocketRinggit demo (FinanceDemo).
# Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
#
# Server-side only: read by api/extract.js (a Vercel function) and by the
# dev server's /api middleware. Do NOT add a VITE_ prefix, since that would
# bake the key into the public client bundle.
# In production, set it under Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
